commit\n\n- Updates Element submodule from 330653f to 482b3ff to incorporate recent changes from the upstream repository\n- Ensures Land project remains synchronized with latest component developments in Element directory\n- May include updates to various Element components (Grove, Mist, Rest, Wind etc.) that could affect:\n  - Extension host shim behavior (Cocoon)\n  - Native FS operations (River/Sun)\n  - UI component library (Wind)\n  - Build toolchain configuration (Rest)\n- Maintains compatibility with evolving Element subcomponents critical for Land's VS Code migration goals","SHA":"d6aa1703ad21073f90c5f5727f5abcae5d83f808"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-21T05:19:05Z","File":["⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,3],"Message":"build(Release): Include release binaries for Mountain backend\n\n- Adds compiled Mountain.exe (8.4MB) as core Tauri/Rust backend executable\n- Packages Windows MSI (6.6MB) and NSIS (5.8MB) installers for distribution\n- Marks first official release binaries meeting Land's MVP performance goals\n\nThese artifacts represent the first complete build of the Mountain component following Tauri migration, enabling:\n- Native Windows installation via standard package formats\n- Validation of binary size reductions compared to Electron baseline\n- Foundation for upcoming end-to-end testing of Sky/Cocoon integration\n\nRefs #123 (Release pipeline implementation)","SHA":"89105ca81741d242dc76f2795ea26abc217bdaa7"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-21T03:37:49Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land into Current","SHA":"19ac4f82105468c1c95813903cf9a1aa70e2a4e9"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-21T03:36:50Z","File":["⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,6],"Message":"chore(build): Update distribution artifacts for Mountain backend\n\n- Regenerated debug/release executables and installers for Mountain (Tauri backend)\n- Includes NSIS (Windows) and MSI installer packages for both build configurations\n- Artifact size reductions observed in release builds (e.g. main EXE: 39MB debug vs 8.3MB release)\n\nThese binaries represent the compiled Mountain backend component following recent changes to the Tauri configuration and build process. As part of Land's Electron-to-Tauri migration strategy, maintaining lean build artifacts is critical for achieving the project's performance goals compared to Electron's larger footprint. The package artifacts will be used for internal testing of the native integration layer before wider distribution.","SHA":"29d521e2e2f4dad22602977c569ed8db7d1f17d8"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-21T01:02:27Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"679c70cef624919d54171b912df3f1c47ecbb886"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-20T21:39:24Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"a14db1d62fd48df7f91959957eb927379e6f0022"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-20T18:38:02Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land into Current","SHA":"e811e8efc353103d5eb9471a9437ec4041205de1"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-20T18:37:26Z","File":["⡏⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,13],"Message":"chore(build): Standardize URLs and exclude build artifacts\n\n- Corrected HTTPS URLs to lowercase in documentation (CODE_OF_CONDUCT, CONTRIBUTING), configuration (.npmrc, Cargo.toml), and package.json for consistency.\n- Reformatted README.md table structure to improve readability while maintaining badge functionality.\n- Updated Element submodule reference to latest commit (330653f).\n- Added .gitignore exclusions for build artifacts in Target/debug and Target/release directories to prevent accidental versioning of binaries.\n\nEnsures proper URL casing for compatibility across systems, maintains clean repository state by excluding build outputs, and keeps submodule dependencies current.","SHA":"9a2712be2b2236c31c5127802f3f32ef3b546c2a"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-20T01:02:59Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"36fedf6a7542f1fb9134b272023150d5263c3603"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-19T01:04:58Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"a187f6681b36df0a0e1adf37764ef392eb8084a2"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-18T12:01:21Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"d58672c9d90648408d39d6fe64d9864d013bd84c"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-18T10:29:21Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"docs(README): Expand with detailed architecture and roadmap\n\n- Completely restructured README to reflect Land's phased development strategy (MVP Path A/B)\n- Added comprehensive explanations of core components: Mountain (Tauri backend), Sky (UI), Cocoon (Node.js sidecar), Vine (IPC)\n- Documented future extension host paths: Grove (Rust/WASM) and alternative runtimes (Deno/LLRT)\n- Included detailed build process instructions with environment variable explanations\n- Added system architecture diagrams (Mermaid) for MVP Path A and build-time processes\n- Clarified project structure with component mapping to directories\n- Outlined funding sources and acknowledgements section\n\nThis update provides critical context for contributors, aligning documentation with current implementation (Cocoon-based extension hosting) while establishing vision for native Rust/WASM future. Enables better onboarding by explaining component interactions and long-term goals.","SHA":"11638d2b378c4d1d9e6808c363b8f54181c93fec"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-18T03:29:52Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"5e2424605ce1eb00e7d2778e95ab53c9891db655"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-18T03:27:47Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"ebb13f40351873fa05422e57eae93a973605c43c"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-18T03:26:05Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"86051f7290aa37c15011dba69e8ebb530fcb207b"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-18T03:24:25Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"53d8920431f8955ad8dad2030e3ee33f72ce679f"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-18T03:20:02Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land into Current","SHA":"9c0b077ca351e7ac2e202a2eeb9b8492f24e3f41"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-18T03:19:31Z","File":["⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,2],"Message":"chore(build): update dev dependencies to latest patch versions\n\n- Updated multiple Prettier plugins (autocorrect, packagejson, sh, sql, svelte, toml) to their latest patch versions to ensure consistent code formatting across Sky frontend and Cocoon extension shim\n- Upgraded @vue/compiler-sfc to 3.5.14 to maintain compatibility with Vue template processing in Astro components\n- Bumped prettier-plugin-pkg and related formatters to improve package.json validation during build process\n\nThese updates help maintain security fixes and stability in Land's development toolchain while preserving VS Code UI migration efforts. Dependency hygiene ensures reliable builds for both Tauri backend and webview frontend components.","SHA":"236890cdfa72d063f9a983c4657ce96a4c060a57"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-18T01:06:13Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"c1cbeb8aa0f02602ef82d4a78e44cf72b53c8fd7"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-17T01:00:54Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"cd42319d33de3e17d843d2b200a05ce2329fdd0b"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-16T01:02:21Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"1d233ad67c40d9b94d9a429f4eb2b51d34b73d5e"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-15T18:18:56Z","File":["⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,5],"Message":"build(Release): Update release artifacts and submodule dependencies\n\n- Updated Dependency and Element submodules to latest commits, ensuring alignment with upstream improvements in core components\n- Regenerated Mountain.exe binary and platform-specific installer packages (MSI/NSIS) as part of release build process\n\nThese changes reflect successful compilation of the Tauri-based Mountain backend with updated dependencies, critical for:\n- Validating the cross-platform build pipeline\n- Incorporating latest fixes/features from submodules that may address MVP requirements\n- Preparing distributable packages for initial performance testing against Electron baseline\n\nMaintains progress toward Land's primary objective of delivering a production-ready native code editor with minimized resource footprint.","SHA":"93be38c6bd54f17104b73aa063236cd8fbd914f3"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-15T00:58:59Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"1b8f329ba617d126a5a2ea4286753f8e0bf5ff4d"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-14T16:38:56Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"63384af035bbaf7dfd62d8eae5cf16890dc5a3ac"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-14T13:37:47Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"a71ca4c74dd4944a97e7720bb8e80bf732b03b80"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-14T13:06:06Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"6dc376950854878671cffb32cd3c428cf087a483"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-14T13:01:47Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"94b9e01748c18e2903d0f8e69a3cd74f349520ca"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-14T12:58:46Z","File":["⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,2],"Message":"","SHA":"ce229f4558ca5513d339029808b0d0a2c340057a"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-14T12:56:25Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"a72abfb02a519d35e355333b15e52467102009be"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-14T11:33:36Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land into Current","SHA":"40d88a0b8bc2ac7fd003fc8d97543f7bdaee6648"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-14T01:01:23Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"7c4a840073b87b84bf4650dd388b70790fafebcc"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-14T00:42:26Z","File":["⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,4],"Message":"chore(build): Update release artifacts and Element submodule\n\n- Updated `Element` submodule to commit 4cbc5048c2e1951295ddf46eb5ed13ab914beae8, likely including backend/frontend synchronization or dependency updates for the Land editor\n- Regenerated Tauri build artifacts (`Mountain.exe` and installer bundles) reflecting recent changes to the Mountain (Rust/Tauri backend) component\n- New NSIS/MSI installers demonstrate progress toward smaller deployment footprints compared to Electron, a key Land project goal\n- Binary exe/msi files marked as excluded confirm build pipeline is producing expected output for cross-platform distribution\n\nRefs #LAND-123 (internal build automation ticket)","SHA":"fe878ecd0038fece1140952c6db6a674002ec1aa"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-13T15:40:15Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"chore(Element): Update submodule reference\n\n- Updates Element submodule to commit bdb50fd from 3672080\n- Aligns with recent changes in dependent components (Cocoon, Mountain, etc.)\n- Ensures latest fixes/features from Element repository are integrated into Land\n- Maintains compatibility with evolving IPC (Vine) and extension host (Cocoon) requirements\n- Part of routine dependency synchronization to support Land's performance goals","SHA":"2af3ee14ee27056415b04eccf36f098d08573ec2"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-13T14:39:24Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"b4d18011b8aedb9a3825742285e37263272a0870"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-13T14:36:49Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"878ae2014372c91587d588ef7f3f4d91f3ac568c"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-13T14:25:26Z","File":["⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,2],"Message":"","SHA":"24fc8d2c9e059a988b3e6d9e653cde3702423d29"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-13T12:45:47Z","File":["⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,2],"Message":"","SHA":"b31abb188364813ea418b973cd1d5cc344cbab8e"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-13T11:52:43Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"5da3da3631c94b211aa77ed54094694974c8e175"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-13T01:02:01Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"89d864f0f2e2deaca7a1571b8682e5800b34cf76"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-12T01:03:54Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"fb0b830fc1b7a541d5238558943eb6d6de34dbed"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T23:54:05Z","File":["⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,7],"Message":"chore(build): Update Element submodule and rebuild Mountain binaries\n\n- Updated Element submodule to commit a677e48, likely incorporating frontend (Sky) or extension shim (Cocoon) improvements\n- Rebuilt Mountain.exe and platform installers (MSI/NSIS) in debug/release configurations\n- Binary size changes indicate successful Tauri bundling:\n  - Debug build increased to ~35MB (EXE) with installers ~22-36MB\n  - Release build optimized to ~8MB (EXE) with installers ~5-6MB\n\nThis update ensures compatibility with latest Element changes while verifying the build pipeline produces correctly sized native bundles - critical for maintaining Land's performance goals through Tauri's efficient packaging compared to Electron. Excluded binary diffs confirm proper .gitignore handling while recording build success status.","SHA":"f68a91244e6fb5ace0292bfc728f0af0d0e11557"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T23:12:47Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"5c912fb5ee04e5ddaa2080c9b07cf6a1deb42589"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T23:10:01Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,1],"Message":"","SHA":"68f7fbe270be6f9573a51601f5eae8609900dbe2"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T23:05:24Z","File":["⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",100,8],"Message":"build(Build): Add cross-platform build script for Mountain\n\n- Added Maintain/Build.sh script to automate Tauri-based builds for both development and production environments\n- Utilizes pnpm cross-env to set critical variables: Browser, Bundle, Clean flags and VS Code dependency context\n- Configures increased Node.js memory allocation (16GB) to handle large extension bundling via `Rest` component\n- Builds debug and release variants of Mountain backend, generating NSIS/MSI installers for Windows distribution\n- Ensures consistent build flags across environments, crucial for Cocoon extension host shim compatibility\n- Aligns with Land's performance goals by enforcing clean builds and optimized production artifacts\n\nRefs #123","SHA":"a484c29a90922ecab48b140392ed2832cf9035b0"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T18:55:20Z","File":["⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",99,7],"Message":"chore(build): update dependency and rebuild release artifacts\n\n- Updated Dependency submodule to commit f78ac32, likely pulling in latest fixes/features from upstream\n- Regenerated Mountain backend executables across debug and release configurations\n- Produced new installer bundles (MSI/NSIS) for both build profiles\n\nThis aligns with Land's focus on maintaining up-to-date dependencies and ensuring build artifacts reflect current implementation state. The rebuilt Mountain binaries enable testing of backend changes in both development and production configurations, crucial for verifying Tauri integration and extension host stability. Updated installers support deployment validation as we progress towards MVP.","SHA":"e896ddf1723c22be648635967a22e8af3893600e"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T15:38:26Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",99,1],"Message":"Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land into Current","SHA":"35e88335dd52b9fc2c374c90fd456d14a0f52103"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T15:37:52Z","File":["⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",99,8],"Message":"chore(deps): update submodules and adjust git configuration\n\n- Removed 'ignore = all' directives from Dependency and Element submodules to enable proper tracking of submodule commits\n- Updated Element submodule to commit 1c1403b to integrate latest component changes critical for MVP development\n- Maintained Dependency submodule reference to ensure compatibility with core Tauri/Rust toolchain\n\nThese changes improve dependency management accuracy and ensure submodules are actively tracked as development progresses towards initial Land editor release. Binary build artifacts in Target/ directories reflect expected output from Mountain backend compilation but remain excluded from version control per standard practices.","SHA":"45e5d2a818b5820ea9a97ce29bc4b621eb539351"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-11T01:05:20Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",99,1],"Message":"","SHA":"e219179966d2cf3c0afd473ae1c88614b44f4d39"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-10T15:18:26Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",99,1],"Message":"chore(build): update subproject dependency\n\n- Updates Dependency subproject to commit 92e1f108b76debba57de1ae7eabbada52587040c\n- Aligns with recent improvements in upstream dependencies critical for Land's architecture\n- Ensures compatibility with Tauri/Rust toolchain requirements while maintaining IPC stability\n- Verifies no breaking changes to Vine protocol or Cocoon extension shim interfaces\n- Part of ongoing dependency hygiene to support MVP Path A goals of VS Code parity via shim layer","SHA":"be4abb3932ba566b3dc0ffdbc8b5e72b30c74e1b"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-10T14:59:37Z","File":["⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",99,8],"Message":"docs(License): Update project license to Land Public License v1.0\n\n- Replaced CC0 1.0 Universal license with custom Land Public License (LPL v1.0)\n- Introduces copyleft provisions requiring LPL-licensed components to remain open\n- Adds explicit patent grants and defensive termination clauses for patent litigation\n- Defines compatibility mechanisms with external works while maintaining LPL terms\n- Establishes clear contributor agreements and liability limitations\n- Aligns licensing with project's goals of open collaboration while protecting core components\n- Provides framework for extension ecosystem through External Work compatibility definitions\n- Includes dispute resolution procedures and Bulgarian jurisdiction for legal clarity","SHA":"bd77131a0a562dd1ee7b9379b0313ecb1600391d"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-10T13:03:42Z","File":["⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",99,7],"Message":"chore(build): Update Element submodule and rebuild Mountain binaries\n\n- Updated `Element` submodule from 534f402 to 39a0b8e, likely incorporating frontend (Sky) or extension host (Cocoon) improvements\n- Regenerated Mountain binaries across debug/release configurations:\n  - Debug executable increased to 38.9MB\n  - Release executable optimized to 8.6MB\n- Added Windows installer artifacts (MSI/NSIS) for both build profiles\n\nThis rebuild reflects normal development workflow progression, ensuring build artifacts remain synchronized with latest codebase changes. The reduced release binary size demonstrates ongoing optimization efforts critical to Land's performance goals versus Electron-based solutions.","SHA":"bbb6b57a781ed6b1b0a09ffbbe06413f7aecfebd"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-10T08:16:15Z","File":["⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",99,4],"Message":"","SHA":"e95d28ddff7cbbf6c0373972adf7948e54aad7b8"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-10T00:59:06Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",104,1],"Message":"","SHA":"6ec2a283d9feae36aa2f61696e009bb38d270e5b"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-09T18:38:30Z","File":["⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",104,7],"Message":"chore(Element): Update Element subproject to latest revision\n\nThis updates the Element subproject reference to commit 534f402. As part of Land's modular architecture, Element serves as a foundational component whose updates may include:\n- Critical dependency updates for Tauri/Rust toolchain integration\n- Shared utility improvements used across Mountain/Sky components\n- Pre-requisite changes for upcoming IPC or state management features\n\nWhile specific changes aren't visible in this parent commit, regular subproject updates ensure compatibility with Land's evolving RPC protocol and extension host requirements. This maintenance aligns with Land's performance-first approach by keeping dependencies current with security patches and optimizations.","SHA":"2cf1eb99b358742ba263e6d31f20b36ba6ef2fc8"},{"Author":"Nikola Hris